        "original_id": "c95c45d4-c266-5f3a-b744-318422058a63",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Madman's Return, \"Rhythm Is a Dancer\", \"Colour of Love\"\n- People: Turbo B, Durron Maurice Butler\n- Organizations: Snap!\n- Topics: album releases, chart performance\n\nFacts:\n- Durron Maurice Butler was born on April 30, 1967.\n- Durron Maurice Butler is known as Turbo B.\n- Turbo B is an American musician, rapper, and beatboxer.\n- Turbo B is best known for fronting the electronic music group Snap!.\n- \"Colour of Love\" was released in December 1991 as the first single from Snap!'s second studio album, The Madman's Return.\n- The Madman's Return is Snap!'s second studio album.\n- \"Rhythm Is a Dancer\" is a song recorded by the German group Snap!.\n- The Madman's Return contains the international hit \"Rhythm Is a Dancer\".\n- \"Rhythm Is a Dancer\" reached No. 1 in France, Ireland, Italy, the Netherlands, Germany, and the United Kingdom, and it peaked at No. 5 in the United States.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
